{"ID":"20240511110537-9srzvrk","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240511110537-9srzvrk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511110537-9srzvrk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511114831-chirx8h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511132745-06pm71t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513125611-aiizepp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:33,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:33\u0026#125;","title":"汉唐-054号（喉蛾方）","type":"doc","updated":"20240513125611"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240511114831-chirx8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114831-chirx8h","updated":"20240511114831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此方专门针对扁桃腺发炎设计的，此病长期困扰许多人，有人开刀取出扁桃腺，却因此丧失了体温的警报系统，且降低了免疫系统。不取出又长期的发炎，实在不知如何处理。"}]},{"ID":"20240511114831-lpuic5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114831-lpuic5i","updated":"20240511114831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   首先我们要明了一个观念，如果只用抗生素来消除炎症，结果必然越用越强，不但无法去除发炎，反而造成胃病，对许多小孩而言，又伤害到心脏，心脏受损则体重立刻上升，〔详见HT-33〕。"}]},{"ID":"20240511114831-5qk5n6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114831-5qk5n6m","updated":"20240511114840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医用药以清除为主，就如同你家客厅有一些垃圾存在，因此蚊蝇及害虫滋生，你如果只请人来杀害虫，而不请人来清垃圾，永远是无法根除的。"}]},{"ID":"20240511114831-x2k2rvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114831-x2k2rvb","updated":"20240511114843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中药有近2000 种清除浊物的药，分别入不同的部位，必须要很了解药性，方可设计此一方剂，首先我们要选择进入腺体的药做导引，加入些除湿，去热的药，同时为确定药要向上走，必须使用药性轻而浮上的药，例如浮萍，永远浮在水上，其性轻且浮，故取用之。如此一来药的复方就出现了，此药效果很快，服後即知，请不断服用到炎症去除为止，轻症2-3天，重症约须二星期，严重到双喉蛾已挤压在一起，无法吞咽时，请找优良之中医，直接在喉蛾上放血，可以立刻消肿，之後再服用本方，必然效果更加。本方呈粉状，无副作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240511114831-bdjys7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114831-bdjys7a","updated":"20240511114831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般小儿∶三餐饭後一茶匙。"}]},{"ID":"20240511114831-vvxzf0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114831-vvxzf0h","updated":"20240511114831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大人∶三餐饭後二茶匙。"}]},{"ID":"20240511114831-rs454d5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114831-rs454d5","updated":"20240511114831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要成份∶浮萍丶桂枝丶白芍丶生姜丶连翘丶薄荷……等。"}]},{"ID":"20240511114831-rlkcu8u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114831-rlkcu8u","updated":"20240511114831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研发人∶美国佛州汉唐中医学院，院长倪海厦医师。"}]},{"ID":"20240511114831-tgpehyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114831-tgpehyw","updated":"20240511114831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"着作权人∶同上。"}]},{"ID":"20240511132743-n8sp4b0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132743-n8sp4b0"}},{"ID":"20240513125611-aiizepp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513125611-aiizepp","updated":"20240513125611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"喉蛾方 (可比照西醫學之扁桃腺發炎)，類似於仙豐製作的候蛾54號。"}]},{"ID":"20240511132744-3bab0nb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240511132744-3bab0nb"}},{"ID":"20240511132745-6b08c5u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-6b08c5u","updated":"20240511132748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-54　喉蛾方"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-lwf1xtq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-lwf1xtq","updated":"20240511132745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2006.12.04B　录校：孟磊）"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-sjinadq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-sjinadq","updated":"20240511132745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐五十四号喉蛾方"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-6nwi2je","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-6nwi2je","updated":"20240511132745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这症太多了，目前很多小孩子都是这样的疾病，然后怎幺办，开刀.其实扁桃腺干什幺用的？是守护病入大脑的，把它拿掉了，今后你脑袋会生什幺病呢？开刀割扁桃体是什幺办法?病人家属一个个也不知道是怎幺想的？都是障眼法，眼不见为净，到底是谁傻？医生还是病人？"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-1wv5swg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-1wv5swg","updated":"20240511154200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"此方专门针对扁桃腺发炎设计的，此病长期困扰许多人，有人开刀取出扁桃腺，却因此丧失了体温的警报系统，且降低了免疫系统。不取出又长期的发炎，实在不知如何处理。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-9hqolq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-9hqolq8","updated":"20240511154201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"首先我们要明了一个观念，如果只用抗生素来消除炎症，结果必然越用越强，不但无法去除发炎，反而造成胃病，对许多小孩而言，又伤害到心脏，心脏受损则体重立刻上升，〔详见HT--33〕。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-k1kukc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-k1kukc0","updated":"20240511132745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"垃圾排不出去了"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-8k7aqwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-8k7aqwv","updated":"20240511154204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中医用药以清除为主，就如同你家客厅有一些垃圾存在，因此蚊蝇及害虫滋生，你如果只请人来杀害虫，而不请人来清垃圾，永远是无法根除的。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-fm513q2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-fm513q2","updated":"20240511132745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样的道理我以前讲课时说过"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-smi6bry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-smi6bry","updated":"20240511154205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中药有近2000 种清除浊物的药，分别入不同的部位，必须要很了解药性，方可设计此一方剂，首先我们要选择进入腺体的药做导引，加入些除湿，去热的药，同时为确定药要向上走，必须使用药性轻而浮上的药，例如浮萍，永远浮在水上，其性轻且浮，故取用之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-4yhap5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-4yhap5m","updated":"20240511132745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 浮萍性辛凉，可向外发。"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-l89w1hi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-l89w1hi","updated":"20240511154208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如此一来药的复方就出现了，此药效果很快，服后即知，请不断服用到炎症去除为止，轻症2-3天，重症约须二星期，严重到双喉蛾已挤压在一起，无法吞咽时，请找优良之中医，直接在喉蛾上放血，可以立刻消肿，之后再服用本方，必然效果更加。本方呈粉状，无副作用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-uv2wxzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-uv2wxzk","updated":"20240511132745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要是用辛凉药发散的，治疗喉病的,伤寒里面讲了很多，？？都可以."}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-pcn7tru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-pcn7tru","updated":"20240511132745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 喉蛾是温病，不属于伤寒，这个温病造成的原因，是相火不收藏，因为有了相火不收，然后又外受六淫之邪，造成相火上升冲击咽喉.在放血的时候，除在喉蛾上放外，本门在手上放，然后要注意收敛其相火，用其辛凉药发散，相火一收，把六淫邪发出去，则病自然会好转。这个里面的用法。"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-6jp9yg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-6jp9yg0","updated":"20240511132745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，这一节课就讲到这里，下课。"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-1y5f0v0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-1y5f0v0","updated":"20240511154212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般小儿︰三餐饭后一茶匙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-x9187zi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-x9187zi","updated":"20240511154213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大人︰三餐饭后二茶匙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132745-06pm71t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132745-06pm71t","updated":"20240511154213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"主要成份︰浮萍、桂枝、白芍、生姜、连翘、薄荷……等。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]}]}